'''Rathalos''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Gacha during [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 206
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Rathalos
|name2 = Rathalos & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rathalos & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Rathalos is entirely outclassed by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Bahamut Cat has higher range and more damage, which are two of the most important stats for a backliner. The only advantages Rathalos has are a marginally higher speed, health and recharge time, a quicker attack rate and a slightly lower cost, which don't add up to make it better than Bahamut Cat. Rathalos also costs much more to upgrade than Bahamut, making it even worse.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

